            <div xml:id="preface">

                <pb facs="0007" n="III" xml:id="pgIII"/>

                <head>Preface</head>
                <p>This volume was prepared under the direct supervision of E. Ralph Perkins,
                    formerly Chief of the Foreign Relations Division now headed by S. Everett
                    Gleason. The compilers of the volume were the late Gustave A. Nuermberger, Velma
                    Hastings Cassidy, John G. Reid, William Slany, John P. Glennon, and former staff
                    members John Rison Jones, Jr., Shirley L. Phillips, and Matilda F. Axton.
                    Further review of the volume was made by Fredrick Aandahl.</p>
                <p>The Publishing and Reproduction Services Division (Jerome H. Perlmutter, Chief)
                    was responsible for the technical editing of the volume. This function was
                    performed in the Historical Editing Section under the direct supervision of
                    Elizabeth A. Vary, Chief, and Ouida J. Ward, Assistant Chief.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> M. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Franklin</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Director, Historical Office,</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Bureau of Public Affairs</hi>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1966-05-26"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >May</hi> 26, 1966</date></dateline></closer>


                <xi:include href="preface-a1.xml" xpointer="preface-a1"/>
